entityDescription:
Terradue Portugal, Unipessoal Lda is a Portuguese company active in the field of Earth Observation (EO), cloud-native processing platforms, and advanced geospatial data infrastructures.The company specialises in the design and validation of scalable EO cloud environments, supporting operational missions, downstream services, and emerging New Space operators requiring robust ground segment and data exploitation architectures.Terradue Portugal contributes to ESA and European programmes through:- system and cloud platform architecture design for EO ground segments and mission exploitation services;
- development and validation of processing workflows, Analysis Ready Data pipelines, and scalable data infrastructures;
- applied R&D in operational and near-operational contexts.
Terradue Portugal leverages expertise developed within the Terradue group, originally founded in 2006 as an ESA spin-off, applying this experience to next-generation EO data platforms and mission exploitation environments.
